  "translation": "And King Ahaz commanded ⟨את⟩ Uriah the priest, saying: Upon the great altar turn into smoke ⟨את⟩ the burnt-offering of the morning and ⟨את⟩ the grain-offering of the evening, and ⟨את⟩ the burnt-offering of the king and ⟨את⟩ his grain-offering, and ⟨את⟩ the burnt-offering of all the people of the land, and their grain-offering and their libations; and all the blood of burnt-offering and all the blood of slaughter upon it you shall sprinkle; and the bronze altar shall be mine, for me to inquire by.",
